    {
      "moduleId": "ModuleDescText",
      "properties": {
        "fontSize": "15px",
        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--point-color, #ed1c24); font-size: 24px;\">KHF&nbsp;2026&nbsp;무료&nbsp;사전등록&nbsp;OPEN!😎</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The&nbsp;Intelligent&nbsp;Hospital&nbsp;-&nbsp;AX와&nbsp;로보틱스가&nbsp;이끄는&nbsp;병원&nbsp;혁신</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">이제&nbsp;병원의&nbsp;경쟁력은&nbsp;장비의&nbsp;수가&nbsp;아닙니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">진단·수술부터&nbsp;행정·물류·보안까지,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: var(--point-color, #ed1c24);\">병원의&nbsp;모든&nbsp;흐름이&nbsp;유기적으로&nbsp;연결되고&nbsp;자동화되느냐</span>가&nbsp;경쟁력을&nbsp;가릅니다.&nbsp;AI로&nbsp;움직이는&nbsp;병원은&nbsp;이미&nbsp;현실이&nbsp;되고&nbsp;있습니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">올해&nbsp;KHF&nbsp;2026은&nbsp;그&nbsp;변화의&nbsp;한가운데를&nbsp;한자리에&nbsp;모았습니다.&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: var(--point-color, #ed1c24); color: #ffffff;\">AI로&nbsp;움직이는&nbsp;병원(The&nbsp;Intelligent&nbsp;Hospital)</span>을&nbsp;만드는&nbsp;핵심&nbsp;기술과&nbsp;실제&nbsp;도입&nbsp;사례를,&nbsp;직접&nbsp;보고&nbsp;만지고&nbsp;검증할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있는&nbsp;자리입니다.</p>",
