        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">💡&nbsp;<strong>행사명&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;KHF&nbsp;2026(국제&nbsp;병원&nbsp;및&nbsp;헬스테크&nbsp;박람회)</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">🚩&nbsp;<strong>장소&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;서울&nbsp;코엑스&nbsp;C&amp;D홀</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">📆&nbsp;<strong>일정&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;8.19(수)&nbsp;–&nbsp;21(금)</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">⏰&nbsp;<strong>시간&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;–&nbsp;18:00&nbsp;(단,&nbsp;마지막&nbsp;날&nbsp;17:00까지)</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">✅&nbsp;<strong>주최&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;대한병원협회</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">✅&nbsp;<strong>주관&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;㈜메쎄이상,&nbsp;미래의료산업협의회</p>",
